       overflow:hidden hides the rest — same degrade-to-static behavior as
       before this was multi-column-aware). */
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    /* Default text color for a slide's nested elements (heading/text/
       button) — without this they'd inherit the page's own theme text
       color straight from body, rendering dark text on what looks like a
